---
# Runner self-test: trigger_change works on every display (spec/support adds it to Niente).
testability: api
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  @echo = para ""
  @line = edit_line { @echo.replace @line.text }
end
----------- test code
edit_line.trigger_change("typed")
assert_equal "typed", edit_line.text
assert_equal "typed", para.text
